        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the issue!\n\nIndeed I don't think this can be fully 100% solved on 'mini.hipatterns' side. The best that can be done is to not error if there are already too many highlight groups created. Either by comparing `vim.tbl_count(vim.api.nvim_get_hl(0, {})) < 19999` (which I don't think I like) or by just using `pcall(vim.api.nvim_set_hl, ...)` (which should probably work, but testing will be a problem).\n\nAnother approach might be to try to convince Neovim upstream to increase the limit. There were precedents for some options. I'll take a look.",
