        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Hi @abeldekat, thank you for your suggestion. I'll probably add this in temporarily as a quick fix. But I do think that this is not a reliable solution as I may have a large file with only a few highlights and I want it to be active. It would be good if I can somehow detect if there are a large numbers of highlights and disable the highlighting. But I know this may be a non-trivial task. \n\nHi @echasnovski, appreciate you looking into this issue! Yeah I do think there needs to be at least a protection mechanism from these sort of infinite loop of errors rendering the editor unusable. Thank you, I'll wait for the upstream resolution for now.",
