        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "@echasnovski,\n\n```lua\nMiniHipatterns.gen_highlighter.hex_color = function(opts)\n```\n\nPerhaps an extra 'threshold' option is possible, stating something like: Do not generate more than threshold highlight groups.\n\n```lua\n  return {\n    pattern = H.wrap_pattern_with_filter(pattern, opts.filter),\n    group = function(_, _, data) return MiniHipatterns.compute_hex_color_group(data.full_match, hl_style) end,\n    extmark_opts = extmark_opts,\n  }\n```\n\nIn `compute_hex_color_group`, I am seeing `H.hex_color_groups`, which could be checked to uphold the threshold.",
            "created_at": "2026-04-10T14:39:51Z",
